{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":18.96},{"sectionId":"build","start":20.08,"end":42.401},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.321,"end":56.561}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.64,"text":"完成的遊戲不只需要成功示範。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.04,"end":7.84,"text":"要驗證沒有鑰匙時開門失敗、拿鑰匙再開門成功，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.107,"end":10.64,"text":"以及未知指令不改變狀態。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.28,"end":14.56,"text":"最終程式會寫出可下載的 JSON 結果，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.12,"end":18.96,"text":"Python 工作區則保留可編輯遊戲原始碼。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":20.08,"end":21.68,"text":"把 /chapter5."},{"sectionId":"build","start":21.92,"end":26.72,"text":"py 中缺少獲勝路線測試的註解改為示範斷言。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.96,"end":29.12,"text":"執行三個檢查，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.2,"end":32.96,"text":"下載 adventure-result."},{"sectionId":"build","start":33.12,"end":33.76,"text":"json，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":34.2,"end":38.08,"text":"再修改指令串列探索另一條路線。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":39.279,"end":42.401,"text":"哪個測試能找出無條件開門的錯誤？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.321,"end":47.761,"text":"哪個測試能找出無條件開門的錯誤？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":49.441,"end":53.201,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":53.841,"end":56.561,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}